The numbers is a list of 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, and 7.
The size is 7.
The turn is 3.
The offset is turn modulo size.
The result is an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 6.
The source is spot plus size minus offset.
If source is at least size, set source to source minus size.
Place item source of numbers into result.

For each value in result, show value.
